        "input_key": "images.image_2",
        "optional": false
      },
      {
        "param": "ref_character_2",
        "input_key": "images.image_3",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "param": "ref_character_3",
        "input_key": "images.image_4",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "param": "ref_character_4",
        "input_key": "images.image_5",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "param": "ref_prop",
        "input_key": "images.image_6",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "param": "ref_prop_2",
        "input_key": "images.image_7",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "param": "ref_character_5",
        "input_key": "images.image_8",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "param": "ref_character_6",
        "input_key": "images.image_9",
        "optional": true
      }
    ],
    "max_reference_images": 9,
    "model_max_reference_images": 16,
    "notes": "多参考图版（9 槽）：image_1=ref_scene 场景编辑底图（编辑目标），image_2/image_3/image_4/image_5/image_8/image_9=ref_identity/ref_character_2/ref_character_3~6 六个角色槽，image_6/image_7=ref_prop/ref_prop_2 两个道具槽。提示词里的 <imageN> 严格对应该槽位的 input_key 序号；TextEncodeQwenImage21 原生支持 image_1..image_16（growable），这里先用 9 个。"
